# Crypto Arbitrage Scanner — environment configuration
# This file lists variable names only. No real secrets. Copy to .env and fill in
# locally if/when you need any of the optional pieces below — the MVP runs with
# NONE of these set, using only public, unauthenticated exchange endpoints.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exchange API keys are NOT required for this version and are not read by the
# scanner today. They are listed here only so the shape is ready if a future
# phase needs account-specific (VIP-tier) trading fees or private network
# metadata. Keys, if ever added, must be READ-ONLY — no trade or withdraw
# permission — and are used server-side only, never sent to the browser.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
BINANCE_API_KEY=
BINANCE_API_SECRET=
BYBIT_API_KEY=
BYBIT_API_SECRET=
OKX_API_KEY=
OKX_API_SECRET=
OKX_API_PASSPHRASE=
KUCOIN_API_KEY=
KUCOIN_API_SECRET=
KUCOIN_API_PASSPHRASE=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Telegram alerts (optional, future phase). The app runs fully without these —
# when unset, the alert module is a no-op. See src/server/telegram.ts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scanner behavior
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Milliseconds between automatic background scans.
SCAN_INTERVAL_MS=45000
# Reject any route built from data older than this, in strict mode.
MAX_DATA_AGE_SEC=90
